Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.97,0:02:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是珍女士吗 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lady Jane? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.52,0:02:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后陛下即将到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her Majesty is just coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.66,0:02:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除非陛下要求你回话 你必须保持缄默\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not to speak anything to her until you are invited to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.17,0:02:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.03,0:02:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Majesty. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.28,0:02:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}西摩女士 请将手按在圣经上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mistress Seymour, will you place your hand upon this Holy Bible…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}承诺并宣誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}And will you promise and swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.73,0:02:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}忠诚 恭敬 谨慎地\N{\fnArial\fs30}to serve Her Majesty Queen Anne…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.75,0:02:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}侍奉王后陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}faithfully, honorably and discreetly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.56,0:02:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}承诺并宣誓汝之言行\N{\fnArial\fs30}And will you promise and swear that your conduct.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.93,0:03:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保持谦逊 贤良\N{\fnArial\fs30}will always be modest, virtuous and good,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.83,0:03:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}始终恪守本分\N{\fnArial\fs30}presenting at all times a godly spectacle to others?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.23,0:03:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我承诺并宣誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do so promise and swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.66,0:03:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}珍女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.06,0:03:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.27,0:03:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王驾到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.62,0:04:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Majesty. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.40,0:04:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大臣阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.47,0:04:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我设法取得了一份\N{\fnArial\fs30}I managed with some difficulty to obtain a copy of.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.52,0:04:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳王后的秘密验尸报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}the secret report of the autopsy on Queen Katherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.60,0:04:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有何发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was discovered?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.62,0:04:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大部分内脏正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}That most of the internal organs were normal…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.77,0:04:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但在心脏外缘发现黑瘤\N{\fnArial\fs30}except for the heart, which had a black growth,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.57,0:04:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来十分骇人\N{\fnArial\fs30}all hideous to behold, which clung closely to the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.46,0:04:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何以致此\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could have caused it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.88,0:04:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的医生 深得我信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her doctor, who I trust completely,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.15,0:04:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他向我禀明 此症状\N{\fnArial\fs30}told me that such a growth was consistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.81,0:04:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}显然是中毒引致\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the evidence of poisoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.42,0:04:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要彻底检查遗体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had the body been properly examined,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.39,0:04:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}定会查到蛛丝马迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}traces of it would have been seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.89,0:04:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怜的凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor Katherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.32,0:04:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非也\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.33,0:04:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无需为她祈叹\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is little need to pray for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.70,0:04:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她神圣的灵魂已永远安息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her holy soul is in eternal rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.07,0:05:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但 我担心她的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… I worry for her daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.05,0:05:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怜的玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.68,0:05:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}稍后再谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall talk later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.12,0:05:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 阁下 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excellency. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.16,0:05:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听闻你的主上喜事临门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear your master is to be congratulated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.83,0:05:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他从土耳其人手里夺得突尼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has taken Tunis from the Turks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.20,0:05:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下真是消息灵通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty is very well informed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.79,0:05:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}皇帝陛下的胜利令人振奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}The threat of the Turkish invasion has indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.10,0:05:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}土耳其入侵的威胁已烟消云散\N{\fnArial\fs30}been lifted by the Emperor's victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.36,0:05:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和平指日可待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peace will follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.58,0:05:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是否会遍及各地呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! Would it follow everywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.11,0:05:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 上帝保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, pray God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.96,0:05:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许将来再也无需\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps one day there will be no more need.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.79,0:05:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}战争或战争警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}for war, or wars alarms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.39,0:05:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与此同时\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the meantime,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.82,0:05:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请代我向皇帝陛下转达问候和祝贺\N{\fnArial\fs30}please convey my love and my congratulations to the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.52,0:05:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}转告他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him that…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.96,0:06:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}转告他 世上所有王公中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him that, of all the princes in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.63,0:06:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我最钦佩他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I admire him the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.66,0:06:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cromwell!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.98,0:06:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如今神圣罗马帝国皇帝挫败了土耳其\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the Emperor has defeated the Turks,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.77,0:06:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的军队可随时调头打我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}his armies are free to turn upon us…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.09,0:06:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我确信 他不久之前确有此意\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a while ago, I swear he would have done so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.16,0:06:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但现在不会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.33,0:06:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳一去\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Katherine's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.40,0:06:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他敌视我们的起因也不复存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}the cause of our enmity is altogether taken away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.13,0:06:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有意与他重修旧好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have a new desire to renew my friendship with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.46,0:06:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你去同乔普斯商谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will talk to Chapuys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.49,0:06:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看这份友谊要价几何\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will find out the cost of friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.99,0:06:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.83,0:06:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}改革进展如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of our reforms?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.08,0:06:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}解散大型修道院的法案\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Bill for the dissolution of the larger monasteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.88,0:06:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将于下次国会议会期间提交\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be laid before Parliament at the next session.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.09,0:06:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚好 克伦威尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Mr. Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.15,0:06:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.12,0:07:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有一事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there was something else:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.26,0:07:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听闻你已有家室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand you have a wife and son.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.36,0:07:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.14,0:07:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}令郎的名字叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your son's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.58,0:07:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}格里高利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gregory.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.00,0:07:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我曾有两个女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had two daughters also. But…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.97,0:07:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但夭折了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they died.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.08,0:07:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带你的妻儿来王宫吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will bring your wife and son to court.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.12,0:07:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我愿接见他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should like to meet them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.74,0:07:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.05,0:08:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.46,0:08:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下请随我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Your Majesty will follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.22,0:08:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虔诚的人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good people,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.43,0:08:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.06,0:08:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}值此濯足节（耶稣受难前夕）之际\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here is the Queen's Majesty come,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.51,0:08:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后陛下驾临\N{\fnArial\fs30}this Maundy Thursday,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.55,0:08:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为汝施舍 沐足\N{\fnArial\fs30}to give you alms and wash your feet,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.77,0:08:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我主保佑 - 主与你同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God bless you! - God keep you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.48,0:09:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天主庇佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}God bless and keep you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.83,0:09:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天主仁慈 庇护福佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}God in his mercy bless you and keep you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.12,0:09:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.36,0:09:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比原先那位王后给的多一倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is twice as much as the old Queen gave!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.68,0:09:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 天主保佑你 - 天主保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God bless you. - God bless you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.77,0:09:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教皇陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.46,0:09:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法国国王陛下觐见\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Royal Highness, the King of France.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.96,0:09:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.14,0:09:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你以朝圣者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.25,0:09:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}及悔罪者的身份前来\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a pilgrim and a penitent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.08,0:09:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理应受到上天垂爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely you deserve heaven's graces.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.11,0:10:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我全心全意\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all my heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.32,0:10:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 欢迎你来罗马 - 教皇陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I welcome you to Rome… - Holiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.81,0:10:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教会的发源地\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Mother of our Church,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.94,0:10:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当其他人离经叛道\N{\fnArial\fs30}When others fall by the wayside,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.51,0:10:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}追慕虚荣和贪欲\N{\fnArial\fs30}through vanity, avarice or lust…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.05,0:10:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你依然对教会和真理\N{\fnArial\fs30}you remain loyal to us,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.82,0:10:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}忠贞不二\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to the truth of Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.19,0:10:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如同孩子对待父亲一般\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a child to a father,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.42,0:10:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在此向您表明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say to you here,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.44,0:10:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}神圣教会的众位红衣主教们作证\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the presence of all these princes of our Holy Church,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.60,0:10:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我愿不惜性命侍奉您\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I would gladly lay down my life in order to serve you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.64,0:10:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}任您差遣\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in whatever way you choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.47,0:10:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我决意颁布绝罚诏书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have decided to carry out the Bull of Excommunication.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.14,0:10:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将英王亨利逐出教会\N{\fnArial\fs30}against King Henry of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.75,0:10:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲本该想尽办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}A father must always seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.71,0:10:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}试图去原谅他的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}for ways to forgive his children,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.59,0:10:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但亨利对我们及我们的信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Henry's crimes against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.96,0:10:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所犯下的罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}and against our faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.43,0:11:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罪孽之深 无法原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}are too profound to forgive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.00,0:11:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非但如此 他既无悔过之心 也无悔过之意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moreover, he shows no repentance, no contrition.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.27,0:11:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}千真万确\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.57,0:11:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英王向来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King of England has always been.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.47,0:11:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最难以相处\N{\fnArial\fs30}the most difficult friend to bear in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.14,0:11:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他历来反复无常\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is continuously capricious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.15,0:11:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}In which case,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.45,0:11:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我确信可以指望你来执行诏书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sure I can rely upon you to execute the Bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.64,0:11:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 教皇？- 我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Holiness…? - My son,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.17,0:11:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想必你意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}surely you realize:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.97,0:11:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我将一国国君逐出教会\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I excommunicate a fellow prince,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.30,0:11:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么这位君主\N{\fnArial\fs30}then that prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.12,0:11:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不仅被神遗弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}is not only separated from God…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.52,0:11:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也被上帝的所有子民遗弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}but also from the communion of the faithful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.01,0:11:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的统治将不再有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}His rule becomes invalid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.90,0:11:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}推翻他是天命所归\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it is a religious imperative to overthrow him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是强大的天主教君主\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a great Catholic Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.14,0:11:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你拥有军队 舰队\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have armies. You have ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.08,0:11:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}火药枪械\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.49,0:12:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为圣父\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I ask you, in all humility,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.18,0:12:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我谦卑地请求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}as your Holy Father…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.84,0:12:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进攻英国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you invade England?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.16,0:12:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}铲除变节者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you remove and kill the apostate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.64,0:12:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}令该国重归正道\N{\fnArial\fs30}and will you return that country to our common faith?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.53,0:12:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}西摩家族古老而有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Seymours are an old and interesting family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.98,0:12:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对法战争中 约翰爵士同国王并肩战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir John fought beside the King during his French campaign.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.78,0:12:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他膝下有二子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He also has two sons:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.14,0:12:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱德华和托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward and Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.11,0:12:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听闻长子稳重冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear the first is steady and cold,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.25,0:12:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小儿子则轻率鲁莽\N{\fnArial\fs30}the other rash.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.91,0:12:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但二人皆野心勃勃 贪婪十足\N{\fnArial\fs30}But both are ambitious, and greedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.28,0:13:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们虽然都宣誓效忠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though they have all taken the oath,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.35,0:13:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但仍不能确信他们是否\N{\fnArial\fs30}what is not yet known is how honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.78,0:13:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已与旧信仰彻底决裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}or completely they have renounced the old religion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.49,0:13:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望不久之后 我们即可揭晓答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is something we must hope, before long, to discover.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.72,0:13:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们可以呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we can?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.89,0:13:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 他们的野心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, the tide of their ambitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.43,0:13:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将会逐渐消失殆尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}can be turned, and will ebb away,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.46,0:13:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而我们也可以从此耳根清静\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we shall hear no more of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.21,0:13:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}启禀阁下 皇室大使求见\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Excellency, The Imperial Ambassador.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.05,0:13:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大使阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Eminency.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.78,0:13:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欢迎之至\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are most welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.65,0:13:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please be seated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.98,0:13:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您真客气 大臣阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are most gracious, Mr. Secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.82,0:13:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正如我所说 国王陛下殷切地希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I told you, His Majesty is most desirous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.64,0:13:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能与皇帝结成联盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make an alliance with the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.70,0:13:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也认为这场结盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I believe also that such an alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.67,0:13:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能给国家带来巨大利益\N{\fnArial\fs30}would be greatly to the benefit of this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.64,0:13:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已与皇帝商议过此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have communicated with the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.44,0:14:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他也迫切地寻找手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}He, also, is eager to find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.75,0:14:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}缔造全新而稳固的联盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make a new and strong alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.68,0:14:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为显诚心\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to show his good will,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.69,0:14:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他愿意劝说教皇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can tell you that he is willing to persuade His Holiness,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.95,0:14:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保罗陛下 取消对国王的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pope Paul, not to publish the sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.39,0:14:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}of excommunication against the King,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.35,0:14:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不然这可能导致国王 王位不保\N{\fnArial\fs30}which would have deprived him of his throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.28,0:14:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sure His Majesty would wish to express.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.06,0:14:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}定会对您主人感激不已\N{\fnArial\fs30}his immense gratitude to your master.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.57,0:14:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们能做什么回报呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in return?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.63,0:14:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}眼下\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the circumstances,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.48,0:14:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他挚爱的姑妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}after the death of his beloved aunt,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.18,0:14:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英国王后凯瑟琳已薨逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queen Katherine of England,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.17,0:14:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}皇帝陛下愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Emperor is prepared to offer the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.58,0:14:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}his support.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.63,0:14:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王与安妮·波林的婚姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the continuation of his marriage to Anne Boleyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.88,0:14:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但前提是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But on condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.16,0:14:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王必须宣布玛丽殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the King declares Princess Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.50,0:14:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为其合法继承人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be his legitimate heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.25,0:15:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我承认 从各方面来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I accept this is, in many ways,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.50,0:15:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这都是皇帝陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}a very generous concession.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.38,0:15:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所做出的一个慷慨让步\N{\fnArial\fs30}on behalf of the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.09,0:15:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他希望国王能够理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}He begs the King to understand it is as far.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.79,0:15:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是他所能做的最大让步\N{\fnArial\fs30}as he is prepared to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.19,0:15:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一定会向国王陛下转达这个提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will certainly put the proposal before His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.86,0:15:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在你赞同下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}With your approval?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.27,0:15:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阁下 即使我赞同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even with my approval, Excellency,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.01,0:15:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这也绝非易事\N{\fnArial\fs30}this may not be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.59,0:15:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 她真漂亮 - 谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's pretty. - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.83,0:16:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}珍·西摩女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Jane Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.93,0:16:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 她是新进宫的 - 看一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's new at court. - Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.00,0:16:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若汝沮丧无比 摆脱欲念\N{\fnArial\fs30}"If thou wilt mighty be, flee from the rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.26,0:16:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}彼念残酷之极 希冀汝可远离\N{\fnArial\fs30}of cruel will, and see thou keep thee free.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.47,0:16:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肉欲奴役之污秽羁绊\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the foul yoke of sensual bondage."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.96,0:16:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我喜欢「肉欲奴役之污秽羁绊」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The foul yoke of sensual bondage". I like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.31,0:16:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你根本就没明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you don't understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.84,0:16:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也不知道被欲念驱使的残酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}or how cruel the will that drives it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.28,0:16:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直至你见识肉欲奴役的果实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until you see the fruits of sensual bondage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.78,0:16:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在悬索上摆动\N{\fnArial\fs30}swinging from a rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.96,0:16:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是珍·西摩女士吗？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lady Jane Seymour? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.23,0:16:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请见谅 有一位朋友在那边等您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me… but there is someone over here,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.64,0:16:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他希望能私下和您说两句\N{\fnArial\fs30}a friend, who wishes a word with you. In private.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.57,0:16:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 哪位朋友？- 这边请 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which friend? - This way, my Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.52,0:17:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}珍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.62,0:17:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.95,0:17:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只请求你一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ask you only one thing:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.68,0:17:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}允许我侍奉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you allow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.13,0:17:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仰慕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}to serve and worship you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.05,0:18:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如同兰斯洛特骑士对待格温尼维尔那般\N{\fnArial\fs30}As Lancelot served and worshipped Guinevere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.42,0:18:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}温文尔雅的女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet gentle Lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.86,0:18:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以成全我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}will you let me so?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.23,0:18:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.29,0:18:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以亲吻你的手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I kiss your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.40,0:18:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.59,0:19:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认识他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know them?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.74,0:19:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁？认识谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who? Know who?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.97,0:19:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}西摩一家\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Seymours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.33,0:19:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我见过爱德华\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may have met Edward,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.83,0:19:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那位长子\N{\fnArial\fs30}the eldest son.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.47,0:19:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是个冷血动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a cold fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.21,0:19:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其他人我不了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know about the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.01,0:19:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怕他们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you afraid of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.57,0:19:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲认为他们暗中支持玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father thinks they may be secret supporters of Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.04,0:19:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽啊玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Mary, Mary…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.82,0:19:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是可惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.70,0:19:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她没能陪母亲一起入土\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's not keeping company with her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.14,0:19:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们说她又病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tell me she is ill again,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.72,0:19:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而国王为了安慰她\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that the King has given permission for her removal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.63,0:19:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同意免去她照顾伊丽莎白的繁务\N{\fnArial\fs30}from Elizabeth's household, for her comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.99,0:20:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这只是出于怜悯之心 别无他意\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an act of kindness. No more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.65,0:20:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 他喜欢她\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He's fond of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.44,0:20:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过去曾是 现在依然是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He always was and he still is,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.48,0:20:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管当着我面 装作另一个样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}though he pretends differently to my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.54,0:20:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的病情如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How ill is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.25,0:20:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就我所知 十分严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very. So I am told.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.95,0:20:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发着高烧 还不时地呕吐\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a fever and constant vomiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.19,0:20:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那蒙上帝恩典\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, with God's good grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.42,0:20:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们也许再也勿需干预她的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we may not have to meddle with her after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.71,0:20:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王说要侍奉你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King has offered to serve you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.61,0:20:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.68,0:20:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}意料之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.04,0:20:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这说明他喜欢挑战\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it means he does not seek an easy conquest!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.22,0:20:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的爱意已经萌芽\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has formed an affection.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.68,0:20:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但更重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's important is that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.46,0:20:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是如何令他的爱意持久不绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}it should be carefully and assiduously nurtured.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.50,0:21:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我必须规劝你 无论国王的话多么有说服力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must urge you not to submit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.30,0:21:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你都不能轻易服从\N{\fnArial\fs30}or yield your virginity to the King,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.10,0:21:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或献出自己的处女之身\N{\fnArial\fs30}however forceful his persuasions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.60,0:21:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}珍不需要那些有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane does not need to be lectured.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.34,0:21:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贞操或谦逊的说教 爱德华\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the need for virtue or modesty, Edward,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.25,0:21:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为那些品德是她与生俱来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}when she possesses them in her nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.66,0:21:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管如此 我们仍需考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, imagine what it would mean for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.27,0:21:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如若国王真的爱上她\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a family,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.83,0:21:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我们家族意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he did grow to love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.05,0:21:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很肯定 朝堂之上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am certainly aware there are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.95,0:21:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人希望另立新后\N{\fnArial\fs30}some at court who would like the Queen replaced.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.69,0:21:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.42,0:21:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.90,0:21:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们是说要我取代现王后吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you saying that I should be Queen instead of her?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.17,0:21:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你愿意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.41,0:21:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利爵士 跟我说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, Sir Henry,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.38,0:21:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和玛格丽特女士订婚了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}are you engaged yet to Lady Margaret?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.22,0:21:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有陛下 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Your Majesty. I…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.25,0:22:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我目前还没有向她求婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have not so far asked for her hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.32,0:22:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的天啊 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God's sake, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.49,0:22:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她很年轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's young.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.58,0:22:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且…\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.79,0:22:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她会为你养育许多孩子 我知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She will give you more children, I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.87,0:22:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也知道国王陛下 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know it, Your Majesty. But…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.10,0:22:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我曾结过婚 必须承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was married before and, I must confess,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.66,0:22:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我更喜欢单身的自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rather like the liberty of not being married again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.92,0:22:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I can understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.45,0:22:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道吗 亨利爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, Sir Henry?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.62,0:22:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在追求一位年轻的女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're courting a young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.13,0:22:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.67,0:22:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们应该再比一场马上枪术\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should joust together again,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.68,0:22:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像以前一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}as we used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.23,0:22:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你总是在比武场上英姿飒爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always did grace the tiltyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.19,0:22:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们往往要大战好几回合\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ran many courses against each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.43,0:22:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}折断许多长枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and broke many lances.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.62,0:23:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们应该再比一次…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should do it again…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.55,0:23:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你来组织吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you can organize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.65,0:23:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}越快越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.18,0:23:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.28,0:23:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, sweetheart! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.65,0:23:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你去哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.39,0:23:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.12,0:23:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要开会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had meetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.79,0:23:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 枢密院的事 - 开到现在？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Privy Council matters. - Until this hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.24,0:23:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.93,0:23:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王的风流韵事不断\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King's affairs never sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.93,0:23:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你自己的呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what of your affairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.40,0:23:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My affairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.85,0:23:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你刚从别人的床上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have just come from another's bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.95,0:24:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不许否认\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Do not deny it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.68,0:24:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 我不否认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well. I shan't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.02,0:24:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更糟糕的是… 你不是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes it worse… is that you have not.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.96,0:24:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另一个女人而抛弃我\N{\fnArial\fs30}forsaken my bed for that of another woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.46,0:24:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而是另一个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for another man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.61,0:24:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh God! Oh my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.42,0:24:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的上帝 果真如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my God! It's true! Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.98,0:24:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太恶心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.55,0:24:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罪孽 这是违背上帝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a sin. It's a sin against God.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.51,0:24:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是违背世俗常理的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sin against nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.85,0:24:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实践之人将遭天谴\N{\fnArial\fs30}And those who practice it are condemned.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.82,0:24:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而永坠炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the Gospels to live forever in purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.16,0:24:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的爱人 有时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes, my love,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.08,0:24:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得和你在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.14,0:25:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经是如同身处炼狱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm already condemned to live in purgatory!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.49,0:25:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}献给你 我的夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.07,0:25:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有一位好丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have fine husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.07,0:25:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沙福克公爵得分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point for the Duke of Suffolk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.07,0:25:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们 请重整长枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, renew your lances.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.83,0:26:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后陛下没来观看今天的比赛吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Her Majesty not attending the tournament today?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.33,0:26:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 显然她担心比赛的激烈\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Apparently she's worried that the excitements.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.13,0:26:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会影响到她未出世的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the tournament might harm her unborn son.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.37,0:26:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者说是她期望的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or so she supposes it to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.50,0:26:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就我而言 我希望她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Personally, I hope she did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.14,0:26:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜访的不是上次那位占星师\N{\fnArial\fs30}visit the same astrologer as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.19,0:26:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}珍女士…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Jane…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.69,0:26:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.20,0:26:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我正要上马比武枪术\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am about to go and joust.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.90,0:26:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知是否有幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you do me the honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.96,0:26:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以允许我佩带你的信物\N{\fnArial\fs30}of allowing me to wear your favors?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.07,0:26:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沙福克公爵得分\N{\fnArial\fs30}A point to the Duke of Suffolk.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.29,0:27:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.72,0:27:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已加入比武名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}has entered the list and will now joust,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.11,0:27:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并很乐意地\N{\fnArial\fs30}à la plaisance,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.85,0:27:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与亨利·诺里斯爵士比试枪术\N{\fnArial\fs30}with Sir Henry Norris.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.66,0:27:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好样的 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done, Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.15,0:28:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你表现得很棒 亲爱的 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You hold on, my love? - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.23,0:28:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让一让 让一让\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.23,0:28:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他死了吗 他死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he dead, is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.62,0:29:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让其他人来帮忙 你靠边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let others help him. You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.90,0:29:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把他小心移至\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him with all care.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.95,0:29:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}帐篷内\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the pavilion,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.64,0:29:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我可以更好地诊治他\N{\fnArial\fs30}where I may serve him better.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.57,0:29:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为他祈福吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And pray for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.30,0:29:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 西摩 波林 - 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seymour! Boleyn! - Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.23,0:29:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 夫人 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam! Madam! Oh Madam!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.01,0:30:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛琪 怎么了？发生了什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madge. What is it? What's happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.20,0:30:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 玛琪 发生了什么事？- 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Madge, what's happened? - O Madam,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.45,0:30:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王比武时落马 摔伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the King has fallen from his horse and been crushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.31,0:30:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.28,0:30:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们说他可能会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}they say he is likely to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.92,0:30:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马克…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mark…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.72,0:30:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我这不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say it is not so.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.62,0:30:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不不不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no, oh no, oh no…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.23,0:30:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please no!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.13,0:30:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的上帝 告诉我这不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh god! Please, say it is not so…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.50,0:30:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的心率很弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}His heart is very weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.32,0:30:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道他是否还能苏醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if he will come back to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.11,0:30:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您会给他放血吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you bleed him?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.22,0:30:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得不需要 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so, your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.43,0:30:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不认为这对他有什么助益\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not see it would help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.03,0:30:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下的生死\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.06,0:30:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在只能听天由命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is now in the hands of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.33,0:31:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们赞颂你 主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confitebimur tibi deus.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.05,0:31:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们称颂你的名…\N{\fnArial\fs30}confitebimur et invocabimus nomen tuum.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.30,0:31:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们这要去哪 - 回白厅去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are we going? - Back to Whitehall.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.96,0:31:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你难道意识不到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you understand anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.85,0:31:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这紧要关头 一切都有可能分崩离析\N{\fnArial\fs30}In such a crisis, all could disintegrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.88,0:31:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以中央一定得先稳住\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the centre has to hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.63,0:31:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}必须由我们来稳住\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we must hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.02,0:31:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大臣阁下 来自多佛的信函 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Secretary. A letter from Dover, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.84,0:31:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大臣阁下 大臣阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Secretary. Mr. Secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.80,0:31:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 有消息吗 - 杳无音讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What news? - There is no news.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.84,0:31:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王仍旧没有生还的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King still shows no signs of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.04,0:31:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自事故发生到现在多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long since the accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.39,0:31:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将近一个小时了 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost an hour ago, Your Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.52,0:31:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}神啊 我们称谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confitebimur tibi deus.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.23,0:31:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们称谢你 因为你的名相近\N{\fnArial\fs30}confitebimur et invocabimus nomen tuum.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.23,0:31:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人都述说你奇妙的作为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Narrabimus mirabilia tua.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.69,0:31:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我到了所定的日期 必按正直施行审判\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cum accepero tempus ego iustitias iudicabo.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.73,0:32:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大臣阁下 该怎么办啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Secretary. What is to be done?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.29,0:32:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我正准备 万一国王驾崩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am making preparations, in the event of the King's death,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.49,0:32:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在阁下的许可下 为伊丽莎白公主加冕\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the coronation of the Princess Elizabeth with your lordship's approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.75,0:32:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她虽未成年\N{\fnArial\fs30}She would be in a minority,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.01,0:32:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但由其母后监护\N{\fnArial\fs30}but under the worship of her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.43,0:32:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并由您来出任护国公\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yourself as Lord Protector.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.17,0:32:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您给玛丽小姐派卫兵了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And have you posted a guard on the Lady Mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.90,0:32:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}港口关闭了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And closed the ports?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.86,0:32:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽在掌握中\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that is in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.53,0:32:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时我也派人去准备召开国会紧急会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}As are preparations for an emergency recall of Parliament.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.59,0:32:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呸 昔时国王可一直不用国会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bah! King's had no need of parliament in the old days!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.68,0:32:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此一时彼一时啊 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are not the old days, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.00,0:33:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您知道 我禁不住要想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I cannot think,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.48,0:33:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王驾崩\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether it would be a bad thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.25,0:33:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到底是好事 还是坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}or a good thing, if he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.81,0:34:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为 作为护国公\N{\fnArial\fs30}For, as Lord Protector, you would,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.89,0:34:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上\N{\fnArial\fs30}ipso facto,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.87,0:34:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就相当于英格兰国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}be King of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.89,0:35:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 陛下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty! Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.15,0:35:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.59,0:35:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢天谢地 陛下还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh thank God. He's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.30,0:36:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 大家先出去 出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}C'mon gentlemen, out, out!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.84,0:36:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此为何物\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.82,0:36:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下跌落马下而安然无恙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must be grateful that his Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.93,0:36:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们应心怀感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}took no hurt in his fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.43,0:36:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.42,0:36:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这意味着你顺利产下太子之事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it means that the safe production of a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.71,0:36:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}变得愈加刻不容缓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}from your womb is more than ever imperative.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.30,0:36:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我恳求\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I beg you to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.77,0:36:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能小心翼翼 善自珍重\N{\fnArial\fs30}always careful with yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.54,0:36:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要用力 别兴奋过度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take no exertions or excitements.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.94,0:36:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将自己封闭起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut yourself away.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.27,0:36:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽可能的远离世事\N{\fnArial\fs30}as much as you can from the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.15,0:36:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望能有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish there was a way I could remove.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.06,0:36:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把西摩小姐从我的侍女中赶走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mistress Seymour from among my ladies,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.78,0:36:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我不敢 我怕触怒龙颜\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I dare not. I think it would anger the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.40,0:36:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这正是我所担心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what I mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.47,0:37:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你为这些鸡毛蒜皮的小事焦虑不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you fret about such little matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.93,0:37:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的烦扰或许会危及到你腹中的胎儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}then your thoughts may poison the child inside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.50,0:37:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.33,0:37:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这并不是鸡毛蒜皮的小事\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little matter to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.92,0:37:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}目前来讲是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.05,0:37:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过阵子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afterwards,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.12,0:37:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要你满足了国王最大的心愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you have given the King his great desire,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.57,0:37:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到时候你想怎么处置她都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you will have all the power to deal with her as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.83,0:37:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}试想 我就是传达天主之意的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think that I am the angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.48,0:37:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}前来传达\N{\fnArial\fs30}come down to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.06,0:37:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怀上圣子的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you carry the Christ child in your belly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.22,0:38:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那是什么 - 由于陛下落马\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - Because of the fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.88,0:38:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}导致您腿上的旧伤口再次开裂 形成溃烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}this old wound on your leg has re-opened, and an ulcer has formed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.99,0:38:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 能治愈吗 - 绝对没有问题 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you heal it? - Oh most certainly, Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.78,0:38:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过暂时需敷上些药\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for now you must wear a dressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.56,0:38:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把腿包扎起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and have the leg bound up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.97,0:38:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然陛下依旧年轻气盛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though Your Majesty is still a young man,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.13,0:38:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但今非昔比\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are not as young as used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.57,0:38:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昔时\N{\fnArial\fs30}In those days.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.69,0:38:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下在马上长枪比武\N{\fnArial\fs30}you would able to joust a whole day.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.03,0:38:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一整天下来都不觉得累\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not feel the effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.97,0:38:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来给你的女儿传送国王谕旨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a message from the King, for your daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.74,0:38:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当面私授\N{\fnArial\fs30}and for her ears alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.49,0:38:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}珍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.14,0:38:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 大人 - 珍小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Grace. - Lady Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.77,0:39:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下要我把这封信送给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty is pleased to send you this letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.74,0:39:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有这个钱包 他希望你能收下它\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this purse. He commends you to accept these gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.68,0:39:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它代表着陛下的心意\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the spirit in which they are offered.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.68,0:39:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真高兴看到陛下康复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so happy you're well.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.48,0:39:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是如此惊恐 不知所措\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was so alarmed, so afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.28,0:39:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我又何尝不是啊… 一想到我的愚行\N{\fnArial\fs30}So was I… when I thought that through my foolishness.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.86,0:39:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 可能导致胎儿流产 - 你的愚行？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you might lose the child. - Your foolishness?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.55,0:39:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为还能像年轻时我行我素 实在大错特错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a mistake to think I could behave as I used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.97,0:39:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}In any case,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.71,0:40:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些无忧无虑的日子已经一去不返了\N{\fnArial\fs30}those carefree days are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.26,0:40:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的女儿被带入宫廷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our daughter was brought to court.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.56,0:40:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人人都对她赞叹不已\N{\fnArial\fs30}And everyone admired her.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.29,0:40:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他日定是绝色美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she will be a great beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.70,0:40:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是毋庸置疑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course she will.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.35,0:40:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有其母必有其女啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.46,0:40:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下会去请求法国国王重新考虑联姻事宜吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you not ask King Francis to reconsider his refusal?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.16,0:40:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是伊丽莎白的婚事\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we delay much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.21,0:40:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再拖延下去的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}to find a good marriage for Elizabeth,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.13,0:40:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕闲言碎语会更甚今日\N{\fnArial\fs30}people will talk, even more than they do already.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.70,0:40:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽都还没有订婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you talk of Elizabeth,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.38,0:40:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么你要谈伊丽莎白的婚事\N{\fnArial\fs30}when Mary is not yet betrothed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.31,0:40:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你当然更该关心你的合法女儿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely you have more of a care for your legitimate daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.90,0:40:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.69,0:41:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.92,0:41:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她把信和钱包原封不动地退了回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She returned the letter unopened, and the purse both.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.35,0:41:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她说在世上她珍视荣誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said that she has no greater treasure in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.56,0:41:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}胜过一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}than her honor,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.34,0:41:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还说如果你真要赐予她金钱的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that if you wanted to give her money, she praise you might do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.74,0:41:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莫如在她体面地婚嫁之际\N{\fnArial\fs30}when she has made an honorable marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.86,0:41:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在此事上她表现得十分谦卑 非常得体\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has behaved herself in this matter most modestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.08,0:41:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}帝国大使阁下求见\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Excellency the Imperial Ambassador.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.25,0:41:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 阁下 - 我在寻思您是否\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excellency. - I wondered if you had put.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.14,0:41:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已向国王陛下转达了皇帝的提议？\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Emperor's proposal to the King?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.59,0:42:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确切地说 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.21,0:42:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我衷心希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish with all my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.16,0:42:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们能够很快达成一致 然而\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we could reach a speedy accommodation. However,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.01,0:42:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在玛丽小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.54,0:42:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}合法子嗣这个问题上\N{\fnArial\fs30}of legitimizing the Lady Mary,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.93,0:42:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}存在一巨大阻碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}there remains one great obstacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.21,0:42:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你指的是王后？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean the Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.82,0:42:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道她痛恨皇帝是凯瑟琳侄儿的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know she hates the Emperor as Katherine's nephew.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.52,0:42:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据悉\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.90,0:42:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当她得知皇上挫败土耳其的消息时\N{\fnArial\fs30}that when she was told of his victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.88,0:42:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她表现得\N{\fnArial\fs30}over the Turks, she looked like a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.62,0:42:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有如丧家之犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}being thrown out of a window.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.13,0:42:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.11,0:42:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们前进的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there is an obstacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.11,0:42:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有了障碍 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}in our path, Excellency,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.27,0:42:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们就得找个办法绕过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}we must find a way around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.43,0:43:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}珍女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.71,0:43:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.96,0:43:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我请求你走近些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray you come closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.97,0:43:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再近些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Closer still.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.28,0:43:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过来 坐我腿上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, sit on my knee.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.96,0:43:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.04,0:44:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我重视你的名誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I respect your honor,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.38,0:44:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.49,0:44:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}往后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.20,0:44:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只会在你家人在场时 与你见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will only see you when other members of your family are present.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.49,0:44:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是现在很想见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just had to see you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.72,0:44:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.62,0:44:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的信物救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your favor saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.37,0:44:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不 - 千真万确\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No… - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.34,0:44:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我躺在那时 你的影像突然浮现\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I lay there, your image came to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.64,0:44:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后我就在誓言中醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I awoke with this promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.24,0:44:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我该怎么说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What should I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.29,0:44:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以吻你吗 珍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you let me kiss you, Jane?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.99,0:44:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.97,0:45:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.14,0:45:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天哪 天哪 这算什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! Oh, my God! What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.45,0:45:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.87,0:45:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正当我身怀六甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just when my belly is doing its business,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.46,0:45:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就让我看到你们在此卿卿我我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find you wenching with Mistress Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.25,0:45:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘘 亲爱的 珍 你先走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hush, sweetheart. Jane, you had best leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.83,0:45:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.28,0:45:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么非得这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you have to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.34,0:45:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 噢 - 冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ah! - Peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.10,0:45:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.02,0:45:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.05,0:45:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.15,0:45:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别哭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.84,0:46:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一对杰克…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two knaves…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.47,0:46:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一对Q 一张K\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two queens and a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.11,0:46:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You win.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.60,0:46:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说我是不是该去看看她… ？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think I should go and see if she…?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.93,0:46:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用了 让她好好睡觉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Let her sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.58,0:46:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.94,0:46:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 胎儿… - 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The baby… - My god!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.20,0:46:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吾儿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.25,0:46:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快去叫人来帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.82,0:46:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 快 - 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hurry. - No… no…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.54,0:46:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 不 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}NO, NO, NO… AAAH!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.25,0:47:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你令我痛失儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have lost my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.69,0:47:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}损失之巨大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot speak of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.33,0:47:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}令我难以言表\N{\fnArial\fs30}the loss is too great,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.57,0:47:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我终于明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.78,0:47:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝是不会赐我男性子嗣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that God will not grant me any male children.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.26,0:47:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等你起床了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you are up,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.46,0:47:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我再跟你谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will speak with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.81,0:48:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这也不能全怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.46,0:48:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这事你只能怪自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no one to blame but yourself for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.73,0:48:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看到你和珍·西摩在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was distressed to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.53,0:48:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我痛心欲绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}with that wench Jane Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.90,0:48:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我对你的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the love I bear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.60,0:48:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至深至浓\N{\fnArial\fs30}is so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.11,0:48:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看你爱上了别人 我心都碎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It broke my heart to see you love others.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.41,0:48:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说过了 等你好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I will speak with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.49,0:48:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我再跟你谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you are well.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.59,0:48:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}NOOO!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.52,0:49:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}私下的谣传原来是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true what they have whispered.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.54,0:49:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我假装两耳不闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shut my ears to them,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.77,0:49:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可现在我知道了 谣传是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}but now I know it to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.51,0:49:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由于受到巫术盅惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made this marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.19,0:49:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我结下了这段婚姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}seduced by witchcraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.80,0:49:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有鉴于此\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for that reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.90,0:49:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这段婚姻无效\N{\fnArial\fs30}consider it to be null and void.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.19,0:49:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝不容\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the evidence is that God.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.92,0:49:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们生下男性子嗣\N{\fnArial\fs30}will not permit us.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.39,0:49:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}便是铁证\N{\fnArial\fs30}male issue…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.64,0:49:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以现在我相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}so now I believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.60,0:50:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我彻底相信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}with all my heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.82,0:50:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我定要另择妻室\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I will take another wife.
